      <p>Effective Date: May 12, 2026 | Last Updated: May 12, 2026</p>
      <p>Don't Lose Your Way is operated by CC3PO LLC, a California limited liability company (EIN 33-2353877). This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information on this platform, in compliance with the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) as amended by the California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA).</p>
