      <li><strong>Journal entries:</strong> If you use the journal feature, entries are stored in your browser's local storage (not on our servers)</li>
      <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> If you use any contact forms, the information you provide is collected via JotForm</li>
      </ul>
