      <li>Device/browser type for compatibility purposes</li>
      <li>General geographic region (country/state level) for content relevance</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>What We Do NOT Collect</h3>
      <ul>
      <li>We do NOT require user accounts or collect email addresses</li>
      <li>We do NOT collect names, phone numbers, or addresses</li>
      <li>We do NOT track individual users across sessions</li>
      <li>We do NOT sell, rent, or share any personal information for commercial purposes</li>
